  "description": "Standard query patterns for EF Core. Offset and keyset pagination, sorting contracts with a\n      guaranteed total order, composable filtering and search, keyset-driven batched streaming, and\n      ambient tracking scopes — plus a development-time advisor that reports missing indexes and\n      non-deterministic ordering from the model alone. Not a query abstraction: every entry point is\n      an extension method over IQueryable, so callers keep writing ordinary LINQ.",
